  {
   "because": "needs-photo",
   "blocks": [],
   "kind": "declared",
   "scope": [
    "front"
   ],
   "wanted": "WHETHER THE BOTTOM RJ-45s HAVE LAMPS. The combo jacks 45 and 47 and the MGMT jack are Ethernet, which this library draws lamped, but the elevation shows lit windows only on the top jacks and nothing in the corners of the bottom ones at 2.27 px/mm. They are drawn bare, as seen, and L76 stands. A close photograph of one stack settles it.",
   "what": "bottom-rj45-lamps"
  },
  {
   "because": "vendor-silent",
   "blocks": [],
   "kind": "declared",
   "scope": [
    "rear"
   ],
   "wanted": "WHICH WAY THE FANS BLOW. The datasheet's Cooling line is empty for both variants and the rear shows fixed fans with no arrows. Unstated rather than guessed.",
   "what": "airflow-direction"
  },
  {
   "because": "vendor-silent",
   "blocks": [],
   "kind": "declared",
   "scope": [
    "front"
   ],
   "wanted": "THE DATASHEET CARRIES NO ORDERING TABLE, so there are no part numbers to attach to an orderable configuration; the device offers its base configuration only.",
